OL,3,AUS tech stocks edge back up after AI
OL,4,Aslowdown fears sent value of firms
OL,5,Aplummeting
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS markets have been steady so far as
OL,8,Fthey reopen following the value of tech
OL,9,Fstocks plummeting worldwide amid fears
OL,10,Fof a slowdown in AI development
OL,12,FThe Nasdaq index, of the largest tech
OL,13,Ffirms listed in the US, was down by
OL,14,Fmore than 5.5% on Thursday; Japan's
OL,15,FNikkei 225 was down 6.3% earlier; and
OL,16,Fthe UK's FTSE 100 index has fallen by
OL,17,Faround 2.2%
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
