OL,3,AUS tech stocks edge back up after AI
OL,4,Aslowdown fears sent value of firms
OL,5,Aplummeting
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after the US midterm
OL,8,Felections, won by the Democrats, where
OL,9,Fdata centres became a key issue for
OL,10,Fvoters - BBC Verify looks at polling
OL,11,Fdata
OL,13,FUS President Donald Trump has restated
OL,14,Fhis support for the AI sector in a
OL,15,Fsocial media post, saying only "foolish
OL,16,Fleadership" would "say no to the riches
OL,17,Fthey bring"
OL,19,FDespite its dramatic drop, Nasdaq is
OL,20,Fstill higher now than it was last year
OL,21,F- this chart shows how it has changed
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
